[en.CHARACTER_OCTAVIO_PIE_NAME]
Octavio Pie

[en.CHARACTER_OCTAVIO_PIE_DESC]
As Pinkie Pie’s cousin and one of the few male members of the Pie family, Octavio Pie had been favored by the elders more than the other ponies in the family since birth. This upbringing led him to develop a proud and somewhat arrogant personality.

[zh.CHARACTER_OCTAVIO_PIE_NAME]
奥塔维奥·派

[zh.CHARACTER_OCTAVIO_PIE_DESC]
作为萍琪派的表弟和派家族少有的男性成员，自出生时就比其他派家族的小马更受到长辈的喜爱，这也让他养成了骄傲和略微有些自大的性格。
